onth for 30 years. There are currently 76 properties listed by owners and dealers for sale, offering multiple options to explore. Chandak Treesourus, Mahindra Marina64, Yukti Anchorpoint Aviara, Ruparel Stardom, Modis Rashmi Signature are nearby under-construction residential projects. Nearby completed societies include Transcon Auris Serenity, Raj Infinia, K Raheja Interface Heights, Gurukrupa Marina Enclave, Transcon & Sheth Auris Bliss, offering ready-to-move homes.\n\n### Narang Vivenda Floor Plan\n\n| Unit Configuration | Unit Size |\n| --- | --- |\n| Narang Vivenda 2 BHK Flat | 837 Sq. Ft. |\n| Narang Vivenda 3 BHK Flat | 1401 Sq. Ft. |\n| Narang Vivenda 4 BHK Flat | 2238 Sq. Ft. |\n If you wish to understand the layout of the rooms and other spaces of the house, taking a look at the floor plans is the best way. You can view different configurations across unit sizes of Narang Vivenda on Magicbricks. Well-appointed bathrooms and balconies with a view are part of these units. You can view the different types of configurations of Narang Vivenda on Magicbricks.\n\n### Narang Vivenda Brochure\n\n Curious to know more about this state-of-the-art Narang Vivenda project? Download this detailed PDF to know more. You can easily find this brochure under the 'Download Brochure' link which is placed on the top right side of the page. To view the Narang Vivenda brochure PDF, fill in your details like name, contact number, and email ID.\n\n### How is the Malad West Real Estate Market?\n\n During the July 2026 quarter, the average pricing for multistorey apartments in Malad West is noted at Rs. 22,130/sq. ft, and the price range spans from Rs. 16,853 to Rs. 27,408/sq. ft, covering diverse budget preferences. In Malad West, Mumbai, residential properties are currently offering rental yields of approx 3.56%. Going by 383 reviews shared by residents, Malad West maintains a rating of 4.07/5.When it comes to shopping and entertainment, World of Titan Infiniti mall and Mothercare 