4 BHK Flats.\n\n### What is the RERA number of Narang Vivenda?\n\nThe RERA number of Narang Vivenda is P51800055504. You can easily find it on RERA official website.\n\n### What is the total area of Narang Vivenda?\n\nNarang Vivenda in Mumbai spans a total area of 3 acres.\n\n### What is the price of Narang Vivenda apartments?\n\nThe residential property in Narang Vivenda in Malad West, Mumbai typically range from 2.88 Cr to 9.50 Cr.\n\n### Where can I download the brochure PDF of Narang Vivenda from?\n\nYou can [download the brochure of Narang Vivenda](https://www.magicbricks.com/narang-vivenda-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343230373637#nav-overview) visiting the Project page. \n\n### What is the address of Narang Vivenda?\n\nThe address of Narang Vivenda is Narang Vivenda, Narang Vivenda is located at Evershine Nagar Road, Malad West, Mumbai, Maharashtra, 400095.\n\n### What are other residential projects near Narang Vivenda?\n\n[Chandak Treesourus](https://www.magicbricks.com/chandak-treesourus-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343037383939), [Gurukrupa Marina Enclave](https://www.magicbricks.com/gurukrupa-marina-enclave-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235303732393039), [Raj Infinia](https://www.magicbricks.com/raj-infinia-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235303139313930), [Mahindra Marina64](https://www.magicbricks.com/mahindra-marina64-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343336323037) and [Transcon Auris Serenity](https://www.magicbricks.com/transcon-auris-serenity-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235303138333732) are other popular residential projects near Narang Vivenda. \n\n### How many towers in Narang Vivenda?\n\nNarang Vivenda has a total of 2 towers in different unit configurations.\n\n### Which is nearest metro station to Narang Vivenda?\n\nThe nearest metro station to Narang Vivenda is Malad West Metro Station. It is 0.6 Kms away from Narang Vivenda.\n\n### What is the price of 3 BHK in Narang Vivenda, Mumbai?\n\nAt Narang Vivenda, the sale price of 3 BHK varies from ₹ 4.82 Cr - 5.27 Cr.\n\n### What is the price of 2 BHK in Narang Vivenda, Mumbai?\n\nAt Narang Vivenda, the sale price of 2 BHK starts from ₹ 2.88 Cr Onwards.\n\n### What is the price of 4 BHK in Narang Vivenda, Mumbai?\n\nAt Narang Vivenda, its top-of-the-class 4 BHK can cost between ₹ 7.70 Cr - 9.50 Cr.\n\nShow more\n\ni\n\nThis project was last updated on 08 September 2026\n\nProperties for Sale\n\n*   [2 BHK Flats for Sale in Narang Vivenda](https://www.magicbricks.com/project-narang-vivenda-2bhk-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n*   [3 BHK Flats for Sale in Narang Vivenda](https://www.magicbricks.com/project-narang-vivenda-3bhk-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n*   [4 BHK Flats for Sale in Narang Vivenda](https://www.magicbricks.com/project-narang-vivenda-4bhk-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n*   [Flats for Sale in Narang Vivenda](https://www.magicbricks.com/project-narang-vivenda-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n\nQuick Links\n\n*   [Narang Vivenda Floor Plan](https://www.magicbricks.com/narang-vivenda-floor-plan-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343230373637)\n*   [Narang Vivenda Brochure](https://www.magicbricks.com/narang-vivenda-brochure-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343230373637)\n*   [Narang Vivenda Photos Videos](https://www.magicbricks.com/narang-vivenda-photo-videos-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343230373637)\n*   [Narang Vivenda Amenities](https://www.magicbricks.com/narang-vivenda-amenities-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343230373637)\n*   [Narang Vivenda Location](https://www.magicbricks.com/narang-vivenda-location-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343230373637)\n\nView More\n\nNew Launched Projects\n\n*   [Ruparel Stardom](https://www.magicbricks.com/ruparel-stardom-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343230303939)\n*   [Shreeji Eternity](https://www.magicbricks.com/shreeji-eternity-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343230363633)\n*   [Shreeji Nakshtra](https://www.magicbricks.com/shreeji-nakshtra-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343331353533)\n*   [Shreeji Bliss](https://www.magicbricks.com/shreeji-bliss