ks Realty Services Limited shall neither be responsible nor liable to mediate or resolve any disputes or disagreements between the Customer/Buyer/User and the Seller and both Seller and Customer/Buyer/User shall settle all such disputes without involving Magicbricks Realty Services Limited in any manner.\n\nAll trademarks, logos and names are properties of their respective owners. All Rights Reserved. © Copyright 2026 Magicbricks Realty Services Limited.","images":[]},{"url":"https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/narang-vivenda","title":"Narang Vivenda | 2, 3, & 4 BHK Apartments @Malad West","raw_content":"# Narang Vivenda Malad West, Mumbai\n\n## Narang Vivenda Overview\n\n|  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Project Name | Narang Vivenda | Location | Malad West, Mumbai |\n| Developer | Narang Realty | Possessions | December 24, 2027 |\n| Project Sub Type | Apartment | Project Type | Residential |\n| Storey | 38 | Towers/Wings | 2 |\n| Land Parcel | N/A | Rera No. | P51800055504 |\n| Per/sqft Onwards | N/A | No. of Units | N/A |\n| Carpet Area | 837 - 2238 Sqft | Typology | 2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK |\n| Total Area | N/A | Security | N/A |\n\nPrice: ₹2.67 Cr\\* - 7.52 Cr\\*\n\n## Narang Vivenda Key Features\n\n* Transport Links: Well-connected to major roads and public transportation.\n* Well-maintained gardens and green areas for a serene living environment.\n* Safe and imaginative play areas that foster creativity and fun for children.\n* Secure Living: 24/7 security and surveillance.\n* Safe and imaginative play areas that foster creativity and fun for children.\n* Narang Vivenda reflects contemporary aesthetics and superior craftsmanship.\n\n## Narang Vivenda Master Plan\n\n[![01JDF3DQ6JN603FXC5VV0P4TTG](https://digipaces.com/storage/01JDF3DQ6JN603FXC5VV0P4TTG.jpg)](https://digipaces.com/storage/01JDF3DQ6JN603FXC5VV0P4TTG.jpg)\n\n## Narang Vivenda Gallery\n\n![Narang-Vivenda-External-1](https://digipaces.com/storage/Narang-Vivenda-External-1.jpg)\n\n![Narang-Vivenda-External-2](https://digipaces.com/storage/Narang-Vivenda-External-2.jpg)\n\n![Narang-Vivenda-Internal-Balcony](https://digipaces.com/storage/Narang-Vivenda-Internal-Balcony.jpg)\n\n![Narang-Vivenda-Internal-Bathroom](https://digipaces.com/storage/Narang-Vivenda-Internal-Bathroom.jpg)\n\n![Narang-Vivenda-Internal-Bedroom-1](https://digipaces.com/storage/Narang-Vivenda-Internal-Bedroom-1.jpg)\n\n![Narang-Vivenda-Internal-Bedroom-2](https://digipaces.com/storage/Narang-Vivenda-Internal-Bedroom-2.jpg)\n\n![Narang-Vivenda-Internal-Dinning](https://digipaces.com/storage/Narang-Vivenda-Internal-Dinning.jpg)\n\n![Narang-Vivenda-Internal-Kitchen](https://digipaces.com/storage/Narang-Vivenda-Internal-Kitchen.jpg)\n\n![Narang-Vivenda-Internal-Living-Room-2](https://digipaces.com/storage/Narang-Vivenda-Internal-Living-Room-2.jpg)\n\n## Narang Vivenda About\n\n**Narang Vivenda** developed by Narang Realty, is a premier residential project located in Malad (West), Mumbai. Narang Vivenda, registered with MAHA RERA number P51800055504, offers thoughtfully designed 2, 3, and 4 BHK apartments with prices starting at ₹2.67 Cr. Residents can enjoy a range of premium amenities including a Fitness Station, Lawn Terrace, Pickleball Court, School Bus Waiting Area, Vegetable Garden, Ola/Uber Parking, Drop-Off Area, Miyawaki Forest, Forest Pavilion, Water Jets Plaza, Multi-Purpose Lawn, Senior Citizen Pavilion, Kids Pool, Dog Run, Bubbler Jets, Social Terrace, Multi-Purpose Court, Active Pavilion, Lounge Pool, Children’s Playground, Family Pavilion, Formal Flower Bed, Sunken Theatre, Performance Pavilion, Shopping Plaza, Squash Court, Gymnasium, Crèche, Indoor Games Room, Banquet Hall, Reception + Lounge, and Washroom. Narang Vivenda enjoys seamless connectivity to major hubs. Upcoming infrastructure includes proximity to Infiniti 2, Inorbit Mall, Billabong High International School, Ryan International School, Zenith Hospital, Thunga Hospital, Mindspace Malad, and NESCO. Narang Vivenda offers a bright deck view, open-air opulence, and an elegant entrance lobby ambiance. Privacy and family living blend seamlessly with spacious, strategically constructed apartments, showcasing a true example of design-oriented architecture. The project features a 40-storey tower with well-planned living spaces. Narang Vivenda's address is Evershine Nagar Road, Malad (West), Mumbai - 400 064.\n\n## Narang Vivenda Floor Plans\n\n[![2 BHK](https://digipaces.com/storage/Narang-Vivenda-Floor-Plan-2BHK.jpg)](https://digipaces.com/storage/Narang-Vivenda-Floor-Plan-2BHK.jpg) \n\n**Name:** 2 BHK\n\n**Carpet Size:** 837 Sqft sq. ft.\n\n**Total Area:** N/A sq. ft.\n\n**Furnishing Status:** Unfurnished\n\n**Price:** ₹26,700,000.00\n\n**Rental:** ₹N/A\n\n**Deposit:** ₹0.00\n\n**Description:** N/A\n\n[![3 BHK](https://digipaces.com/storage/Narang-Vivenda-Floor-Plan-3BHK.jpg)](https://digipaces.com/storage/Narang-Vivenda-Floor-Plan-3BHK.jpg) \n\n**Name:** 3 BHK\n\n**Carpet Size:** 1401 Sqft sq. ft.\n\n**Total Area:** N/A sq. ft.\n\n**Furnishing Status:** Unfurnished\n\n**Price:** ₹46,800,000.00\n\n**Rental:** ₹N/A\n\n**Deposit:** ₹0.00\n\n**Description:** N/A\n\n[![4 BHK](https://digipaces.com/storage/Narang-Vivenda-Floor-Plan-4BHK.jpg)](https://digipaces.com/storage/Narang-Vivenda-Floor-Plan-4BHK.jpg) \n\n**Name:** 4 BHK\n\n**Carpet Size:** 2238 Sqft sq. ft.\n\n**Total Area:** N/A sq. ft.\n\n**Furnishing Status:** Unfurnished\n\n**Price:** ₹75,200,000.00\n\n**Rental:** ₹N/A\n\n**Deposit:** ₹0.00\n\n**Description:** N/A\n\n## Narang Vivenda Price\n\n| Name | Carpet Area | Price | Furnishing Status |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK | 837 Sqft sq. ft. | ₹2.67 Cr\\* | Unfurnished |\n| 3 BHK | 1401 Sqft sq. ft. | ₹4.68 Cr\\* | Unfurnished |\n| 4 BHK | 2238 Sqft sq. ft. | ₹7.52 Cr\\* | Unfurnished |\n\n## Narang Vivenda Amenities\n\n24/7 CCTV Surveillance & Security\n\nAutomated Robotic Car Park\n\nChildren Play Area\n\nDedicated Yoga Area\n\nEarthquake Resistant Structure\n\nEfficient Entry and Exits\n\nGrand Entrance Lobby\n\nGymnasium\n\n## Narang Vivenda Features\n\nAnti-skid tiles adorn the Balcony and Toilets\n\nElegant Building Entrance Gate\n\nExhaust Fan Provision Granite Kitchen platform\n\nExquisite Branded CP Fittings and Sanitary Ware in the Toilets\n\nLuxurious Vitrified Tiles grace the Living/Dining area, Master Bedroom\n\nOil-bonded distemper walls\n\n## Narang Vivenda Walkthrough Video\n\n## Narang Vivenda Location\n\n  \n\n**Narang Vivenda Address (Sales Gallery/Office/Experience Center):**   \nEvershine Nagar Rd, Malad Ushma Nagar Malad (West) Mumbai 400064\n\n## Narang Vivenda Location Advantages\n\nMindspace Malad\n\n5 mins\n\nBillabong High International School\n\n10 mins\n\nZenith Hospital\n\n9 mins\n\nNESCO\n\n20 mins\n\n## Narang Vivenda Construction Status\n\n[![01JDF3DQ77YTWS350Y4CSX4JKZ](https://digipaces.com/storage/01JDF3DQ77YTWS350Y4CSX4JKZ.jpg)](https://digipaces.com/storage/01JDF3DQ77YTWS350Y4CSX4JKZ.jpg)\n\n[![01JDF3DQ798E458ZG6ZJD3WZDQ](https://digipaces.com/storage/01JDF3DQ798E458ZG6ZJD3WZDQ.jpg)](https://digipaces.com/storage/01JDF3DQ798E458ZG6ZJD3WZDQ.jpg)\n\n## Developer\n\n![01JDF285SPBWGPGZFCMKZ3J2ZE](https://digipaces.com/storage/developer-logos/01JDF285SPBWGPGZFCMKZ3J2ZE.png)\n\nNarang Realty\n\n**Narang Realty is a leading real estate developer committed to creating exceptional living and commercial spaces that reflect innovation, quality, and sustainability. With a legacy of trust spanning several decades, Narang Realty has successfully delivered a wide range of landmark projects across residential, commercial, and retail sectors. The company's vision is to elevate lifestyles through thoughtfully designed spaces that blend modern architecture with functionality. Every project is crafted with meticulous attention to detail, ensuring the highest standards of construction and customer satisfaction. With a focus on delivering excellence, Narang Realty is redefining urban living by offering a perfect balance of luxury, convenience, and comfort. Driven by a passion for excellence, Narang Realty continues to transform cityscapes and set new benchmarks in the real estate industry**\n\n## Narang Vivenda FAQ's\n\nNarang Vivenda offers a variety of thoughtfully designed apartments, including 2 BHK, 3 BHK, and 4 BHK units.\n\nThe possession of apartments at Narang Vivenda is expected to start in December 2028.\n\nThe project features a 40-storey tower, providing a range of well-planned living spaces.\n\n## Narang Vivenda Maharashtra RERA Details\n\nNo documents available.\n\n## Get In Touch\n\n## Latest Projects in Malad West\n\n[PCPL Falcon Crest](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/pcpl-falcon-crest)   [Modirealty Olive](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/modirealty-olive)   [Chaitanya Ethics Orovia](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/chaitanya-ethics-orovia)   [Malad Vrindavan CHSL](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/malad-vrindavan-chsl)   [Aquarock Aquarose](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/aquarock-aquarose)   [H Rishabraj Ceramont](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/h-rishabraj-ceramont)   [Ruparel Stardom](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/ruparel-stardom)   [Anchor Point Aviara](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/anchor-point-aviara)   [Priyam Residency](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/priyam-residency)   [Stans Marve Royal](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/stans-marve-royal)   [Modis Rashmi Signature](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/modis-rashmi-signature)   [Ajmera Boulevard](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/ajmera-boulevard)   [Raj Imperia](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/raj-imperia)   [Royal Bliss](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/royal-bliss)   [Shreeji Tapovan](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/shreeji-tapovan)   [Arkade Eden](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/arkade-eden)\n\n## Share this Project:\n\n ","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AvG77mJVaHk","title":"Narang Vivenda, Malad West, Mumbai - YouTube","raw_content":"# Narang Vivenda, Malad West, Mumbai\n## MBTV by Magicbricks\n4660000 subscribers\n11 likes\n\n### Description\n12093 views\nPosted: 26 Mar 2025\nNarang Vivenda is a premium residential project located in the vibrant neighbourhood of Malad West, Mumbai. Spread across 3 acres in Evershine Nagar, this development offers thoughtfully designed, spacious units in with G+38 floors. Choose from 2 ,3 and 4 BHK apartments with carpet areas ranging from 837 sf to 2,238 sf with high-class amenities.\n\nStrategically located,Narang Vivenda offers easy access to renowned schools, healthcare facilities, and major tech parks, ensuring convenience at your doorstep. \n\nThe project is expected to be ready for possession by December, 2029. \nSubscribe to MBTV for the latest real estate updates and more.\nRERA ID: P51800055504\nRuparel Stardom Project Review:\nPrivate lobby with 3 BHK? #MaladWest #SampleFlat #RuparelStardom\n#MumbaiPropertyMarket #RealEstateTrends #HomebuyingTips #MBTV #Magicbricks\n\nFOLLOW US:\nFACEBOOK:  https://bit.ly/31EGdfn\nTWITTER:   https://bit.ly/3I7zem3 \nINSTAGRAM:   https://bit.ly/3Vsyzi7\nLINKEDIN:   https://bit.ly/47xE8m2\nYOUTUBE: https://bit.ly/3gMLebX\n\nSUBSCRIBE US: http://bit.ly/2E1KLmM\nFOR MORE PROJECTS: https://bit.ly/3juQ9F6\nFOR MORE LOCALITIES: https://bit.ly/3jtBKco\nWEBSITE: https://www.magicbricks.com/\n\n\n### Transcript:\n[संगीत] मुंबई में अगर आप थ या फोर बीएच के खरीदना चाहते हैं और आपका बजट ढाई से 5 करोड़ का है तो आपके पास ऑप्शंस की कमी नहीं है लेकिन फिर भी बात अटकती है एमेनिटीज यूनिट प्लान लोकेलिटी और सोशल इंफ्रास्ट्रक्चर पर जाकर आज हम जिस प्रोजेक्ट का रिव्यू करने जा रहे हैं उसका यूएसपी ही है उसकी कनेक्टिविटी और उनके स्पेशियस फ्लैट्स तो बने रहिए हमारे साथ [संगीत] हेलो एंड वेलकम टू एमबीटीवी आई एम शिप्र आर्य एंड फॉर टुडेज प्रोजेक्ट रिव्यू वी आर एट नारंग विवेंदा इन एवरशाइन नगर मलाड वेस्ट द यपी ऑफ दिस प्रोजेक्ट इज इट्स रिमार्क बल लोकेशन एंड कनेक्टिविटी स्पेशियस अपार्टमेंट्स विद मैन ग्रू व्यू ड इट कैच योर अटेंशन लेट्स डिक डीपर इन टू दिस प्रोजेक्ट बट बिफोर दैट प्लीज डू नॉट फॉरगेट टू सब्सक्राइब टू एमबीटीवी मलाज वेस्ट में तकरीबन 3 एकड़ में फैला हुआ एक री डेवलपमेंट प्रोजेक्ट है नारंग विवेंदा प्रोजेक्ट में कुल दो टावर्स हैं जिसमें डेवलपर ूथ और फर बीएच के कॉन्फिडेंस ऑफर कर रहे हैं विद कार्पेट एरिया बिटवीन 837 स् फीट टू 2238 स् फीट द डेवलपर इज टारगेटिंग टू गिव द पजेशन बाय दिसंबर 2027 एंड एस पर द रेरा द प्रोजेक्ट इज सेट टू बी कंप्लीटेड बाय दिसंबर 2029 यहां पर g प 38 स्टोरीज का स्ट्रक्चर होगा जिसमें थ्री फ्लोर्स पोडियम पार्किंग के लिए रिजर्व्ड है प्रोजेक्ट का मास्टर प्लान देखें तो यहां 74 एरिया ग्रीन स्पेसेस के लिए डेडिकेट किया गया है द प्रोजेक्ट ऑफर्स मोर दन 30 एमेनिटीज दैट आर वाइडल स्प्रेड ऑन द ग्राउंड लेवल सम यूनिक एमेनिटीज इंक्लूड मियावाकी फॉरेस्ट फॉरेस्ट पविल्यन मल्टी पर्पस लॉन वेजिटेबल गार्डन फिटनेस स्टेशन पिकल बॉल कोर्ट मल्टीपर्पज कोट स्क्वाश कोट शॉपिंग प्लाजा बैंकट हॉल एंड मेनी मोर अब बात करते हैं फ्लोर प्लान की द प्रोजेक्ट ऑफर्स सिटी व्यू एंड मैंग्रोव व्यू यूनिट्स एक फ्लोर पर आठ यूनिट्स हैं आठ कॉमन लिफ्ट्स हैं और एक फायर लिफ्ट दो स्टेयर केसेस और एक सर्वस टॉयलेट भी दिया गया है सभी यूनिट्स में डेक प्रोवाइड किया जा रहा है ्र एंड फ बीएच के यूनिट्स कम विद एन एडिशनल स्टडी रूम प्रोजेक्ट में 1400 101 स् फीट कार्पेट एरिया का 3 बीएच के मिल रहा है जिसमें 65 स् फीट का एक डेग भी है यह रेरा कार्पेट में इंक्लूडेड नहीं है एंटर करते ही सबसे पहले फॉयर है जिसके बाद स्टडी है फिर है डाइनिंग एंड लिविंग एरिया विद एन अटैच डेक ऑन वन साइड ऑफ द डाइनिंग एरिया इज द यूटिलिटी नेक्स्ट टू व्हिच इज बेडरूम नंबर वन विथ अटैच वॉशरूम अब चलते हैं डाइनिंग रूम की दूसरी तरफ जहां किचन है और फिर उसके सामने है कॉमन वॉशरूम फिर है बेडरूम नंबर टू एंड द मास्टर बेडरूम विद अटैच वश रूम एंड द ड्रेसिंग एरिया इसके साथ ही इस प्रोजेक्ट में आपको 10.5 फीट फ्लो टू सीलिंग हाइट भी मिलेगी अब तक हमने प्रोजेक्ट के मास्टर प्लान फ्लोर प्लान यूनिट प्लान और एमेनिटीज के बारे में बात की है सो वी होप यू हैव नाउ अंडरस्टूड अबाउट द प्रोजेक्ट इट्स टाइम टू टॉक अबाउट अदर इंपोर्टेंट डिटेल्स लाइक प्राइसिंग लोकैलिटी एंड सोशल इंफ्रास्ट्रक्चर ऑफ द प्रोजेक्ट द प्राइसिंग ऑफ अ ू बीएच के फ्लैट मेजरिंग 837 स् फीट ऑफ कार्पेट एरिया स्टार्टस फ्रॉम 2.71 करोड़ और अगर आप 1401 स् फीट की 3 बीएचके में इंटरेस्टेड हैं तो यू माइट हैव टू शेल आउट 4.67 करोड़ 15658 स् फीट का फेट एरिया के 4 पीएचके के लिए द स्टार्टिंग प्राइस इज 5.57 करोड़ वैसे मलाड वेस्ट का प्रेजेंट प्राइसिंग पर स्क्वायर फिट रेट ₹ 19650 पर स्क्वा फिट का है तो इस हिसाब से इस लोकैलिटी में आपको 2 बीएच के 1.80 करोड़ 3 बीएचके र 2.80 करोड़ और 4 पीच के 3.5 करोड़ तक में मिल जाएंगे द ह्यूज प्राइस डिफरेंस इन एवरेज लोकेलिटी प्राइस एंड द प्रोजेक्ट प्राइसिंग मे बी ड्यू टू द मॉडर्न एमेनिटीज बिगर कार्पेट एरिया व्यू एंड द डेवलपर बैकग्राउंड कीमत के हिसाब से नारंग विवेंदा का कंपैरिजन प्रोजेक्ट के सामने ही बन रहे रूपर हेल स्टारडम से किया जा सकता है हमने रूपर हेल स्टारडम का भी प्रोजेक्ट रिव्यू किया है मेक श्यर टू चेक दैट वीडियो द लिंक इज इन द डिस्क्रिप्शन मलाड वेस्ट मुंबई का वो एरिया है जहां से आपकी हर जरूरत की चीजें बस कुछ ही दूरी पर मिल जाएंगी प्रोजेक्ट साइट एवरशाइन नगर पर है और यह मलाड वेस्ट की प्रीमियम लोकेशंस में आता है प्रोजेक्ट से मेजर अप्रोच रोड्स न्यूलिंक रोड मलाड मार्वे रोड और मिड चौकी सिग्नल है क्लोजेस्ट मेट्रो स्टेशंस वलना मिट चौकी और मलाड वेस्ट मेट्रो स्टेशंस है वहीं मलाड रेलवे स्टेशन तकरीबन 30 किलोमीटर दूर है मुंबई सेंट्रल रेलवे स्टेशन 311 किमी जबकि छत्रपति शिवाजी महाराज इंटरनेशनल एयरपोर्ट 14 किलोमीटर दूर है मलाड वेस्ट में घर खरीदने में लोगों की दिलचस्पी पहले से काफी बड़ी है माइन स्पेस एंप्लॉयमेंट हब बनने के बाद होम बाइंग और रेंटल रिक्वायरमेंट्स दोनों में बढ़ोतरी देखी गई है सिर्फ यही नहीं यहां से अक्सा बीच बस 7 किलोमीटर दूर है आसपास के स्कूल्स हॉस्पिटल्स और शॉपिंग सेंटर्स नारंग विवेंदा को और भी आकर्षक रेसिडेंशियल ऑप्शन बनाते हैं नारंग विवेंदा को डेवलप कर रहे हैं नारंग रियल्टी जिन्होंने 1988 से एमएमआर में कई प्रोजेक्ट डेवलप किए हैं और तकरीबन 6.5 मिलियन स्क्वायर फीट पर कंस्ट्रक्शन किया गया है इन अ बलिंग सिटी लाइक मुंबई थर रिसर्च इज एसेंशियल बिफोर इन्वेस्टिंग इन एनी प्रोजेक्ट उम्मीद है कि इस रिव्यू से आपको एक इफॉर्म डिसीजन लेने में थोड़ी हेल्प मिलेगी अगर आपको यह वीडियो पसंद आया हो तो प्लीज लाइक और शेयर करें साथ ही एमबीटीवी को सब्सक्राइब करना ना भूलें कैमरा पर्सन संजय के साथ दिस शप आर्या सी य इन द नेक्स्ट वीडियो [संगीत]","images":[]},{"url":"https://propertyseeds.in/mumbai_properties/narang-vivenda-malad-west","title":"Narang Vivenda Malad West – Premium 2, 3 & 4 BHK Luxury Homes | Price & Offers","raw_content":"[Skip to content](#main)\n\n[![Propertyseeds](https://propertyseeds.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/aa-removebg-preview.png)](https://propertyseeds.in/)\n\n\n\n[# NARANG VIVENDA MALAD WEST](https://propertyseeds.in/mumbai_properties/narang-vivenda-malad-west/)\n\nMALAD WEST\n\n2,3,4BHK & DUPLEX\n\n₹2.88cr-18.45cr\\*\n\nShare to Friends & Family\n\n[![NARANG VIVENDA MALAD WEST 2BHK BEDROOM](https://propertyseeds.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/NARANG-VIVENDA-MALAD-WEST-2BHK-BEDROOM.jpg)](https://propertyseeds.in/mumbai_properties/narang-vivenda-malad-west/ \"NARANG VIVENDA MALAD WEST\")\n\n![](https://getproperty.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/home.jpg)\n\n## Configuration: 2,3,4BHK & DUPLEX\n\n![](https://getproperty.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/area.jpg)\n\n## Carpet: 837-4500Sq.Ft\n\n![](https://getproperty.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/office-building.jpg)\n\n## Total Floors: 38\n\n![](https://getproperty.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/architect-1.jpg)\n\n* Under Construction\n\n![](https://getproperty.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/key-features.jpg)\n\n## Possession: DEC-2029\n\n![](https://getproperty.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/rera-logo.png)\n\n## MAHARERA: P51800055504\n\n[CONTACT SALES](#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjE0NyIsInRvZ2dsZSI6ZmFsc2V9)\n\nRating..\n\nRating...\n\n![](https://getproperty.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/home.jpg)\n\n## Configuration: 2,3,4BHK & DUPLEX\n\n![](https://getproperty.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/area.jpg)\n\n## Carpet: 837-4500Sq.Ft\n\n![](https://getproperty.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/office-building.jpg)\n\n## Total Floor: 38\n\n![](https://getproperty.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/architect-1.jpg)\n\n* Under Construction\n\n![](https://getproperty.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/key-features.jpg)\n\n## Possession: DEC-2029\n\n![](https://getproperty.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/rera-logo.png)\n\n## MAHARERA: P51800055504\n\n30:50:20\n\nZero Brokerage\n\n[Download Brochure](#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjE0NyIsInRvZ2dsZSI6ZmFsc2V9)\n\n## Project Overview\n\n# NARANG VIVENDA MALAD WEST\n\n## Narang Vivenda Malad West – Luxury Living at Evershine Nagar\n\nNarang Vivenda is an exclusive residential development by **Narang Realty**, located in the prime and well-developed locality of **Evershine Nagar [Malad West](https://propertyseeds.in/mumbai_properties/shreeji-eternity-malad-west/) Mumbai**. Spread across a sprawling **3-acre land parcel**, this premium project offers a perfect blend of luxury, comfort, and connectivity, making it an ideal choice for modern homebuyers and investors. **MahaRERA NO. [P51800055504](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)**\n\nThe project features a **single tower with 2 wings**, thoughtfully designed with **2 basements + ground + 3-level podium + 4th floor amenities + 5th to 38th floors**. Each wing offers **4 spacious apartments per floor with 5 high-speed lifts**, ensuring privacy and convenience for residents. **Surface parking** is also available, adding to the overall comfort.\n\n📞 Call Now: [**+91-8828161678**](https://wa.link/munuqm)\n\n**Best offers and flexible payment plans are currently available** – don’t miss this opportunity to own a **luxury home in Mumbi**\n\nRead More\n\n## Features\n\n* GYM\n* KIDS AREA\n* CCTV\n* SWIMING POOL\n* INDOOR GAMES\n* RAIN WATER HARVESTING\n* Gated Community\n* Security Systems\n* Lift\n* Air-condition\n* Roof Top Garden\n* EV Charging Point\n* Fire Safety System\n* Banquet Hall\n\n## Gallery\n\n## Configuration's & Pricing\n\nCONFIGURATION\n\nCARPET AREA\n\nPRICE ₹\n\n2BHK\n\n837 Sq.Ft\n\n₹ 2.88cr\\*\n\n3BHK\n\n1401 Sq.Ft\n\n₹ 5.27cr\\*\n\n4BHK\n\n2238 Sq.Ft\n\n₹ 8.35cr\\*\n\nDuplex\n\n2800-4500 Sq.Ft\n\n₹ On Request\\*\n\n[Get Pricing Details](#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjE0NyIsInRvZ2dsZSI6ZmFsc2V9)\n\n[Prices are subjective, please contact sales team.](#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjM0MjMiLCJ0b2dnbGUiOmZhbHNlfQ%3D%3D)\n\n## Floor Plan\n\n[Download Floor Plans](#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjE0NyIsInRvZ2dsZSI6ZmFsc2V9)\n\n## Location Map\n\n[![](https://propertyseeds.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/map2-1024x712.webp)](#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjE0NyIsInRvZ2dsZSI6ZmFsc2V9)\n\nConnectivity\n\n5-15 min……………………………………………………….  \n MALAD RAILWAY STATION   \n MITH CHOWKI  \n LINK ROAD  \n MALAD S.V. ROAD  \n EVERSHINE NAGAR\n\nHealth Care\n\n5-15 min……………………………………………………….  \n Namaha Hospital  \n Balajee Hospital  \n Raksha Multispeciality Hospital Pvt. Ltd.  \n Surana Hospital and Research Centre.  \n Apex Superspeciality Hospitals – Best Hospital in Borivali\n\nEducation\n\n5-15 min……………………………………………………….  \n Atharva Institute of Management Studies  \n Ryan International School, Kandivali East, Mumbai – CBSE  \n Shri Balaji International School  \n Pinnacle High International School  \n ORCHIDS The International School – CBSE School in Borivali  \n BILLA BONG HIGH SCHOOL\n\nEntertainment\n\n5-15 min……………………………………………………….  \n Infiniti Mall  \n Oberoi Mall  \n Inorbit Mall  \n Growel’s 101 Mall  \n Hub Mall  \n D MART\n\n## About Developer\n\nLoading...\n\n[![NARANG REALTY](https://propertyseeds.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/NARANG-REALTY.jpg)](https://propertyseeds.in/developer/narang-realty/ \"NARANG REALTY\")\n\n# NARANG REALTY\n\n## Narang Realty – Trusted Developer in Mumbai\n\nNarang Realty is a well-established real estate developer in Mumbai, with a strong presence since **1988**. Over the years, the company has built a solid reputation for delivering high-quality **residential and commercial projects** across the **Mumbai Metropolitan Region (MMR)**.\n\nWith a portfolio of **10+ landmark developments** covering approximately **7.1 million sq. ft.**, Narang Realty has successfully delivered homes to more than **3,550 families**. The brand is known for its **trust, timely delivery, and consistent construction quality**, making it a preferred choice among homebuyers and investors.\n\nDeveloper's focuses on creating thoughtfully designed spaces that offer comfort, functionality, and modern lifestyle features. Each project reflects careful planning, quality materials, and attention to detail, ensuring long-term value for customers.\n\nThe company is also committed to **sustainable development**, with a vision to reduce environmental impact and move towards a greener future. By adopting modern construction techniques and eco-friendly practices, Narang Realty continues to contribute positively to Mumbai’s urban growth.\n\nWith decades of experience and a customer-first approach, **Narang Realty** continues to shape premium living spaces that stand the test of time.\n\n## For Site Visit & More Details - [NARANG VIVENDA MALAD WEST](https://propertyseeds.in/mumbai_properties/narang-vivenda-malad-west/)\n\n### 📞 Call Now: [**8828161678**](https://wa.link/munuqm)\n\nBook your site visit today and explore premium properties in Mumbai.\n\nShow More\n\n## Contact Sales\n\nLoading...\n\n## Enquire About This Property\n\nMahaRERA Reg No.: P51800055504 Available at\n\n![](https://propertyseeds.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/NARANG-VIVENDA-MALAD-WEST-QR-CODE.jpg)\n\nDisclaimer: The content is for information purposes only and does not constitute an offer to avail of any service. Prices mentioned are subject to change without notice and properties mentioned are subject to availability. Images for representation purpose only. We may share data with rera registered sub brokers/companies/projects for further processing. We may also send updates to the mobile number/email id registered with us. All Rights Reserved.\n\nCONTACT SALES\n\nLoading...\n\n[CONTACT SALES](#Contact)\n\nContact Sales\n\n ","images":[]},{"url":"https://housiey.com/projects/narang-vivenda","title":"Narang Vivenda Malad West - Brochure, Pros&Cons, PriceSheet","raw_content":"Narang Vivenda Malad West - Brochure, Pros&Cons, PriceSheet\n\n[Home](/)\n[Mumbai](/in/mumbai)\n\n>\n\n[Malad West](/in/mumbai/malad-west)\n\nLast updated: May 21, 2026\n\n![Project image 1](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Narang_Vivenda_Elevation_View--1734783135745-img-1280w.webp)![Project image 2](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Narang_Vivenda_Entrance_Lobby--1714721838307-img-1280w.webp)![Project image 3](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Narang_Vivenda_Family_Pavilion--1714721839293-img-1280w.webp)![Project image 4](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Narang_Vivenda_Gymnasium--1714721839605-img-1280w.webp)![Project image 5](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Narang_Vivenda_Indoor_Games--1714721839922-img-1280w.webp)![Project image 6](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Narang_Vivenda_Landscaped_Podium--1714721840189-img-1280w.webp)![Project image 7](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Narang_Vivenda_Lobby--1714721841119-img-1280w.webp)![Project image 8](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Narang_Vivenda_Master_Bedroom--1714721843500-img-1280w.webp)![Project image 9](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Narang_Vivenda_Multipurpose_Court--1714721843535-img-1280w.webp)![Project image 10](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Narang_Vivenda_Pool_Deck--1714721844605-img-1280w.webp)![Project image 11](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Narang_Vivenda_Pathway--1714721844650-img-1280w.webp)![Project image 12](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Narang_Vivenda_Seating_Area--1714721846602-img-1280w.webp)![Project image 13](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Narang_Vivenda_Sunken_Lawn--1714721846970-img-1280w.webp)![Project image 14](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Narang_Vivenda_Swimming_Pool--1714721847347-img-1280w.webp)![Project image 15](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Narang_Vivenda_Banquet_Hall--1714721885842-img-1280w.webp)![Project image 16](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Narang_Vivenda_Creche--1714721885949-img-1280w.webp)![Project image 17](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Narang_Vivenda_Deck_View--1714721886669-img-1280w.webp)![Project image 18](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/narang-vivenda_1772351268002-461115287-1280w.webp)\n\n# Narang Vivenda Malad West\n\n[By Narang Realty](/builder/narang-realty)|\n\nEvershine Nagar, [Malad West](/in/mumbai/malad-west)\n\n₹2.88 Cr - 9.45 Cr All inc.\n\n![Narang Vivenda Malad West - main project image](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Narang_Vivenda_Elevation_View--1734783135745-img-1280w.webp)\n\n![Narang Vivenda Malad West - image 2](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Narang_Vivenda_Entrance_Lobby--1714721838307-img-1280w.webp)\n\n![Narang Vivenda Malad West - image 3](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Narang_Vivenda_Family_Pavilion--1714721839293-img-1280w.webp)\n\n![Narang Vivenda Malad West - image 4](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Narang_Vivenda_Gymnasium--1714721839605-img-1280w.webp)\n\n![Narang Vivenda Malad West - image 5](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Narang_Vivenda_Indoor_Games--1714721839922-img-1280w.webp)\n\n13+ more\n\nWatch This Project Reel\n\nSee highlights of Narang Vivenda\n\n[View Full Reel](/reels)\n\nExplore More Reelsin Malad West\n\nWatch reels of other projects in the same locality\n\n[Watch All Reels](/reels)\n\nWatch This Project Reel\n\nSee highlights of Narang Vivenda\n\n[View Full Reel](/reels)\n\nExplore More Reelsin Malad West\n\nWatch reels of other projects in the same locality\n\n[Watch All Reels](/reels)\n\n## Narang Vivenda Overview\n\n![Land Parcel](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fland-parcel-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n3 acres\n\nLand Parcel\n\n![Towers](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fnumber-of-towers-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n2\n\nTowers\n\n![Floors](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fnumber-of-floors-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nG+38\n\nFloors\n\n![Config](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fconfig-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n2, 3, 4 BHK\n\nConfig\n\n![Carpet Area](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fcarpet-area-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n837-2238 sqft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![RERA NO.](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2FRERA-number-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nP51800055504\n\nRERA NO.\n\n![Possession Status](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpossession-status-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nAdvance Stage (<1 yr)\n\nPossession Status\n\n![Target Possession](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Ftarget-possession-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nMar 2027\n\nTarget Possession\n\n![RERA Possession](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2FRERA-possession-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nDec 2029\n\nRERA Possession\n\n![Litigation](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flitigation-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nYes\n\nLitigation\n\n### About Narang Vivenda\n\nNarang Malad West Project Overview  \nVivenda Project will be constructed on 3 Acres of land parcel, 2 Tower with G+38 floors having 2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK premium residences.  \n  \nVivenda Location  \nProject is located On Evershine Nagar Road, Malad West, Mumbai with -  \nValnai-Meeth Chowky Metro Station - 700m  \nInfiniti Mall - 1.4km  \nMalad Station - 2.5km  \n  \nVivenda Malad West Project Amenities  \nFirst is Internal amenities -  \nVitrified Tiles, Granite Platform, SS sink, Earthquake Resistance, CP Fittimg, Powder coated aluminium sliding window & many more  \n  \nNarang Realty Malad West External Amenities  \nProject has 35+ amenities with likes of -  \nMultipurpose court  \nMultipurpose lawn  \nGymnasium  \nSwimming Pool  \nKid's play area  \nBanquet hall  \nParty hall  \n  \nNarang Realty Vivenda Malad West Parking -  \nProject has one type of car parking facility -  \n1) Ground  \n  \nVivenda Possession -  \nRera Possession - December 2029  \nTarget Possession - March 2027  \n  \nCarpet Area & Floor Plan  \nVivenda Malad West project has 2BHK, 3BHK, 4BHK premium residences with -  \n2BHK - 837 sqft  \n3BHK - 1401 sqft  \n4BHK - 2238 sqft  \n  \nVivenda floor plan  \nTower floor plan will have 6 flats 2 lifts & 1 staircase on each floor  \n  \nVivenda Malad West sample flat is ready to view at the site  \n  \nNarang Vivenda Mumbai Prices & its details can be found in the price section & Vivenda Malad West brochure can be downloaded from the link mentioned below. Project has been praised by the home buyers & Narang Realty Malad West review is 4 out of 5 from over all the clients who have visited the site.\n\n## Narang Vivenda Location\n\nOn Evershine Nagar Road, Malad West, Mumbai\n\n* Valnai-Meeth Chowky Metro Station - 700m\n* Infiniti Mall - 1.4km\n* Malad Station - 2.5km\n\n![360 background](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2F360-background-image.webp&w=1280&q=75)\n\n![Housiey Logo](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Flogo1.png&w=256&q=75)\n\n![360](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2F360-tour-icon.png&w=128&q=75)\n\n## Narang Vivenda Videos\n\n## Narang Vivenda Pros & Cons\n\n![Pros-icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fthumbs-up-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nPros\n\n![toggle-arrow](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Farrow-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1.The project is situated in a prime location with excellent connectivity to Malad railway station, metro station, and Infiniti Mall.\n\n2.The project features large 2, 3, and 4BHK units, which are hard to find in today’s trend of compact apartments. Ideal for buyers looking for roomy, comfortable living spaces.\n\n3.The 3 and 4BHK apartments feature a dedicated walk-in wardrobe space, adding a touch of luxury and enhancing the overall living experience.\n\n![Cons-icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fthumbs-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nCons\n\n![toggle-arrow](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Farrow-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1.Due to the orientation of the towers facing one another, the garden views from some apartments are obstructed, and residents may experience reduced privacy.\n\n2.The 4BHK apartment with a carpet area of 2,238 sq. ft. has an unoptimized layout, with a significant portion of space taken up by non-functional passage areas.\n\n## Narang Vivenda Amenities\n\n### Internal Amenities\n\n![Vitrified Tiles](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652438961711-img.webp)\n\nVitrified Tiles\n\n![Granite Kitchen Platform](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/granite-kitchen-platform_External_1770712604025-330259421.webp)\n\nGranite Kitchen Platform\n\n![Stainless Steel Sink](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1646987626444-img.webp)\n\nStainless Steel Sink\n\n### External Amenities\n\n![Swimming Pool](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652447054692-img.webp)\n\nSwimming Pool\n\n![Kids Play Area](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446278292-img.webp)\n\nKids Play Area\n\n![Garden](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/garden_External_1770724836898-39687774.webp)\n\nGarden\n\n![Multi Purpose Court](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446516876-img.webp)\n\nMulti Purpose Court\n\n![Kids Pool](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446316261-img.webp)\n\nKids Pool\n\n![Squash Court](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446975301-img.webp)\n\nSquash Court\n\n![Multi Purpose Lawn](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/multi-purpose-lawn_External_1770725036557-780469581.webp)\n\nMulti Purpose Lawn\n\n![Yoga Zone](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652447479516-img.webp)\n\nYoga Zone\n\n![Meditation Zone](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446402032-img.webp)\n\nMeditation Zone\n\n![Banquet Hall](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/banquet-hall_External_1770879343210-675134790.webp)\n\nBanquet Hall\n\n![Seating Area](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/seating-area_External_1770882751990-34368358.webp)\n\nSeating Area\n\n![Creche Play Area](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/creche-play-area_External_1770879490683-604838905.webp)\n\nCreche Play Area\n\n![Acupressure Pathway](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/acupressure-pathway_External_1770879264034-878823551.webp)\n\nAcupressure Pathway\n\n![Indoor games](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/indoor-games_External_1770730286045-726989382.webp)\n\nIndoor games\n\n![party lawn](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/party-lawn_External_1770789871561-959473538.webp)\n\nparty lawn\n\n+2 More\n\n## Narang Vivenda Master & Floor Plan\n\n### Master Plan\n\n![Narang Vivenda Master Plan](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Narang_Vivenda_Refuge_Master_Plan--1714721910775-img-1280w.webp)\n\n### Floor Plan\n\n![Narang Vivenda Floor plan 1](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Narang