T, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 3BHK in Narang Vivenda starts from **₹5.27 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **1401 sq. ft.** – ₹5.27 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 4BHK in Narang Vivenda starts from **₹9.45 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **2238 sq. ft.** – ₹9.45 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nIt is built across **3 acres** with **2** towers with **G+38** floors. Each floor has **6** flats per floor, **2** lifts, **1** staircases. It is available in **2BHK/3BHK/4BHK** configurations with carpet areas ranging from **837** to **2238 sq. ft.**\n\nNarang Vivenda provides dedicated car parking facilities for residents. The exact parking type and the number of spaces allotted per unit are mentioned in the Unit Plan, which you can download for free on the Narang Vivenda project page on Housiey.\n\nIt is located at **On Evershine Nagar Road, Malad West, Mumbai**.  \nNearby landmarks include:  \n**• Valnai-Meeth Chowky Metro Station - 700m**   \n**• Infiniti Mall - 1.4km**   \n**• Malad Station - 2.5km**\n\nThe following payment plans are available:  \n• **CLP ( Construction Link plan)** - Regular Standard Slabwise Payment as per construction, Maximum loan possible up to 90%  \n  \n**Note:** In some cases, payment plan deviations can be considered based on your preferred terms. The final schedule is confirmed after your site visit.\n\nThe minimum down payment starts from **₹43.00 Lacs**, inclusive of all taxes. EMI options are also available. Use the EMI calculator on the project page to check monthly instalments based on your loan amount and tenure.\n\nYes, it is approved by leading banks including **Central Bank of India**, **Union Bank of India**, **Bank Of India**, **Bank Of Baroda**, **Citi Bank**, **Kotak Mahindra Bank**, **Axis Bank**, **State Bank Of India**, **ICICI Bank**, **HDFC BANK**. The complete approved bank list is available in the Banks section on Housiey. Home loan eligibility depends on the bank's lending policy and your profile.\n\nNo - Housiey follows a strict no-brokerage policy. You pay only the builder's official price - no commission, no hidden charges, and no middlemen. This applies to all projects listed on Housiey.\n\nIt is developed by **Narang Realty**, a trusted real estate brand with over **38 years** of experience and more than **10 completed projects** across **Mumbai City, Mumbai suburban and Thane**.  \n**Some of their notable developments include:**  \n  \n • **Narang Privado** in Vartak Nagar Thane, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Asteria by Court yard** in Pokhran Road Thane, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Narang Bangur Nagar** in Goregaon West, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Narang Valora** in Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\nThe Commencement Certificate is available. The **Occupancy Certificate (OC)** will be applied for closer to the possession date, as per standard regulatory timelines. All currently available documents are listed in the Documents section on Housiey.\n\nYes - book a free site visit through Housiey. We arrange a free Ola cab pickup and drop from your location.  \n  \nAlternatively, you can schedule an online project presentation directly by the builder from home. Both options are 100% free with no obligation to buy.\n\nYes - NRIs can purchase this project under FEMA regulations. Payment can be made via NRE or NRO accounts. Home loans are available from Indian banks with a co-applicant. Housiey's team assists NRI buyers with documentation and Power of Attorney requirements remotely - 100% free.\n\n**Malad West** is one of Mumbai's sought-after micro-markets with consistent property appreciation.  \n  \nThis project by **Narang Realty** - with 38 years of experience - offers 2BHK/3BHK/4BHK at ₹2.88 Cr to ₹9.45 Cr, making it a strong long-term investment opportunity.\n\nBuying through Housiey gives you:  \n(1) No brokerage - you pay the builder's exact price  \n(2) Free Ola cab site visit  \n(3) Online project presentation by the builder from home  \n(4) Free legal consultation via Housiey Legal  \n(5) Honest Pros & Cons review on every project  \nAll services are 100% free with no obligation.\n\nThe price sheet and brochure for this project are available for free download on Housiey. Click the \"Price Sheet\" or \"Brochure\" button on the project page. No registration is required for instant download.\n\nHousiey has a **4.8 rating** on Google with **2,395+ reviews**.  \n  \nOver **8,500 families** have purchased homes through Housiey across **8+ cities** with no brokerage and direct builder pricing. Housiey has conducted **1.2 lakh+ free site visits** and facilitated over **₹8,000 crore** worth of property transactions.\n\n## Explore Related Projects\n\n![Sheth Irene](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/sheth-irene_1773211317528-220150597-1280w.webp)\n\n[### Sheth Irene](/projects/sheth-irene)\n\n₹ 1.45 Cr - 4.50 Cr (All inc)\n\n[Sheth Creators](/builder/sheth-creators)\n\n442- 1355sqft\n\nMalad West\n\nOct 2028\n\n1BHK\n\n442sqft\n\n₹1.45 Cr\n\n2BHK\n\n680sqft\n\n₹2.25 Cr\n\n(1+1)BHK Jodi\n\n884sqft\n\n₹2.90 Cr\n\n(1+2)BHK Jodi\n\n1119sqft\n\n₹3.75 Cr\n\n(2+2)BHK Jodi\n\n1355sqft\n\n₹4.50 Cr\n\n[Sheth Creators](/builder/sheth-creators)Developer\n\n![Gurukrupa Marina Enclave](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Marina_Enclave_Elevation--1687947769005-img-1280w.webp)\n\n[### Gurukrupa Marina Enclave](/projects/gurukrupa-marina-enclave)\n\n₹